  /// allowed size of the model. Depending on the input data, the size of the
  /// model might affect its performance. The value is an integer that ranges
  /// from 100000 to 2147483648 . The default value is 33554432 .
  /// sgd.maxPasses - The number of times that the training process traverses
  /// the observations to build the MLModel . The value is an integer that
  /// ranges from 1 to 10000 . The default value is 10 . sgd.shuffleType -
  /// Whether Amazon ML shuffles the training data. Shuffling data improves a
  /// model's ability to find the optimal solution for a variety of data
  /// types. The valid values are auto and none . The default value is none .
  /// We strongly recommend that you shuffle your data.
